// Greatest labeled margin strictly below the greatest kept margin.
// One margin returns nothing. A smaller margin returns that margin.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE mprev ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG mprev rank

IMPULSE mprev 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "mprev" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
